# RFC 9112, sections 2 to 7 and 11: each sentence that holds MUST, MUST NOT,
# or SHALL, and what holds it in `std.http1`. A line is
#   <section> | <first words of the sentence> | test <name>
# or
#   <section> | <first words of the sentence> | reason <why std.http1 has nothing to do with it>
# `tests/http1_standard.rs` fails for a sentence that is in no line.
